# IDP Estate Installer

This package installs the estate converger. You enter your password once, here; after that
nothing on this Mac needs a Terminal command to stay current.

## What's installed

- `/usr/local/estate/sbin/estate-converge`: the converger, owned by root
- `/Library/LaunchDaemons/ai.estate.converge.plist`: runs it every 2 minutes

## What it does

Every 2 minutes it fetches main from github.com/chidionyema/idp and cuts a read-only release
of the estate intents and tools into `/usr/local/estate/releases`. It then points your
`~/.estate` at that release. An intent that is not on main does not run as though it were.

You can watch it live in the Delivery panel on /fleet.

## More information

See: https://github.com/chidionyema/idp/blob/main/docs/tickets/2026-09-27-merged-is-operating.md
